('Owner''s Manual', 'Provenance attachments on chapters',
 'Attach dated 2008–2014 artifacts to the chapters they prove.',
 'Mirror the dossier attachment machinery for manual chapters: private storage bucket, signed URLs, founder upload, and a dated provenance line under the chapter title. A stranger cannot verify the vision, but they can verify that it was filed in 2008. This is the largest credibility multiplier available to the manuscript.',
 'planned', 1, 'Sprint 3.2b', 10),
('Owner''s Manual', 'Write the eight spine chapters',
