 'planned', 1, 'Sprint 3.2c', 20),
('Owner''s Manual', 'Print edition that looks like a book',
 'Title page, colophon, running heads, part dividers, page numbers, printed glossary and index.',
 'The current print route dumps chapters. The goal is that a PDF handed to a C-level reads as a set book, not an export. Print CSS only, no PDF library.',
